{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/lib-hero-with-logo-3840x1240.png?t=1748629920\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Song of Steel &amp; Spirits</strong> is a turn-based tactical RPG set in a pixelated realm where swords are sharp, magic is unstable, and alcoholic spirits are abundant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble a crew of mercenaries, misfits, and magically inebriated wizards in an attempt to escape the dungeon and uncover the mystery of how they ended up there in the first place. Plot your moves across tight grid-based maps, combining strategic positioning, class synergies, and perfectly timed strikes to survive brutal dungeon encounters, monster ambushes, and the occasional bar brawl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Fast Turn-Based Combat </strong>\u2013 Master a grid-based combat system that is easy to learn and difficult to master, with positional strategy, environmental hazards, and enemy champions with unique abilities and quirks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/Untitled_video__8___2_.gif?t=1748629920\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Party-Based RPG</strong> \u2013 Level up your heroes and unlock new abilities that add endless possibilities of team-ups. Expect tactical challenges that will test your mettle, that only all your party members working together can solve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/12.png?t=1748629920\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/13.png?t=1748629920\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u231b <strong>Timed Strikes &amp; Momentum</strong> \u2013 Master abilities and block enemy attacks by activating your action button at the precise moment in the animation for maximum impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/timed-animations.gif?t=1748629920\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect strikes contribute towards your character's <strong>momentum</strong>. Maxing out your momentum grants your hero a bonus action that triggers immediately in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save your momentum for the perfect window of opportunity, perhaps during a boss fight when you need it most to deliver the killing blow.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Satirical Fantasy World</strong> \u2013 Explore a land of brooding necromancers, belly-dancing snake-charmers, and bureaucracy-obsessed goblins while you fight your way to the surface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Pixel-Perfect Nostalgia</strong> \u2013 Classic 16-bit inspired visuals with expressive sprites, quirky animations, and lovingly handcrafted maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf7b <strong>Tavern Tales</strong> \u2013 Recruit new party members and uncover mysteries, lore, and perhaps even the recipe to the perfect draft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/meet-your-heroes.png?t=1748629920\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/Jule-Standing-128x128.gif?t=1748629920\" /></div><strong>Jule</strong>: <i>&quot;I really should lay off the experimental ale.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/ArcherGirl-Idle-128x128.gif?t=1748629920\" /></div><strong>Farryn</strong>: <i>&quot;<strong>Somebody</strong> needs to stay sober and be the designated ranger.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/Duward-Idle-128x128.gif?t=1748629920\" /></div><strong>Duward</strong>: <i>&quot;Like a fine wine I only get better with time; I did not intend for that to rhyme.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/Feng-Idle-128x128.gif?t=1748629920\" /></div><strong>Feng</strong>: <i>&quot;If there is greater meaning in life than stealing from the rich, I have yet to obtain it.&quot;</i>  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/mr-careless-whisker-128x128.gif?t=1748629920\" /></div><strong>Mr. Purreach</strong>: <i>&quot;Being a devout cleric of the Church of Nepeta Cataria precludes me from indulging in such frivolities. But doesn't mean I can't watch.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/Stol-128x128.gif?t=1748629920\" /></div><strong>Stol</strong>: <i>&quot;For long I've had nothing but spirits for company. Its a welcome change to have ones of the living variety.&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/know-your-enemies.png?t=1748629920\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/Raze-128x128.gif?t=1748629920\" /></div><strong>Lord Raze</strong> wants YOU to join the undead army. Will you answer the call?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/Moltraine-128x128.gif?t=1748629920\" /></div><strong>Lady</strong> <strong>Moltraine</strong>: <i>&quot;You look nutritious-ss. You'll make a fine meal for my pets-ss.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/Papa-Gromp-128x192.gif?t=1748629920\" /></div><strong>Gromp</strong>: <i>&quot;Nobody bosses around my goblins. 'cept me, of course.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647680?t=1748629920","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/41caa1eda6a44ea0f4815c60a67680ae877887fe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748629920","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/03a84ee772f6d0f4486c3d7f1b9c9502183ade92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748629920","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/03a84ee772f6d0f4486c3d7f1b9c9502183ade92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748629920","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_pa