3647680/extras/13.png?t=1748629920\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u231b <strong>Timed Strikes &amp; Momentum</strong> \u2013 Master abilities and block enemy attacks by activating your action button at the precise moment in the animation for maximum impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/timed-animations.gif?t=1748629920\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect strikes contribute towards your character's <strong>momentum</strong>. Maxing out your momentum grants your hero a bonus action that triggers immediately in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save your momentum for the perfect window of opportunity, perhaps during a boss fight when you need it most to deliver the killing blow.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Satirical Fantasy World</strong> \u2013 Explore a land of brooding necromancers, belly-dancing snake-charmers, and bureaucracy-obsessed goblins while you fight your way to the surface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Pixel-Perfect Nostalgia</strong> \u2013 Classic 16-bit inspired visuals with expressive sprites, quirky animations, and lovingly handcrafted maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf7b <strong>Tavern Tales</strong> \u2013 Recruit new party members and uncover mysteries, lore, and perhaps even the recipe to the perfect draft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/meet-your-heroes.png?t=1748629920\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647680/extras/Jule-Standing-128x128.gif?t=1748629920\" /></div><strong>Jule<